[2026-03-14T21:04:13.574Z] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01XNKyKpWKp9zc1atu26ZJeD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JYSSdUMAcuQntGaQMNYpEJ","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md","offset":1,"limit":100},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9642,"cache_read_input_tokens":18140,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":9642,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01AcAwQJJqU6JH3s8U7y74Zn","session_id":"f65fbc7d-7519-48b6-af78-4161af35e017","uuid":"593df162-8892-417d-aa03-fb3b683511c0"}
[2026-03-14T21:04:13.786Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JYSSdUMAcuQntGaQMNYpEJ","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# AirbnbClone Test Specification\n     2→\n     3→## Page: Login / Register (`/login`)\n     4→\n     5→<!-- Components: LoginForm, RegisterForm, AuthToggle -->\n     6→\n     7→### Component: AuthToggle\n     8→\n     9→#### Test: Auth page defaults to login mode\n    10→- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/login` for the first time (not logged in).\n    11→- **Expected:** The page displays in login mode with the email input field visible, a \"Log In\" submit button, and a toggle link reading \"Don't have an account? Register\" at the bottom.\n    12→\n    13→#### Test: Toggle from login to register mode\n    14→- **Initial state:** User is on `/login` in login mode.\n    15→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Don't have an account? Register\" link.\n    16→- **Expected:** The form switches to register mode showing name and email fields, a \"Register\" submit button, and the toggle link changes to \"Already have an account? Log In\".\n    17→\n    18→#### Test: Toggle from register back to login mode\n    19→- **Initial state:** User is on `/login` in register mode.\n    20→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Already have an account? Log In\" link.\n    21→- **Expected:** The form switches back to login mode with only the email field and \"Log In\" button visible.\n    22→\n    23→#### Test: Toggle preserves no stale input between modes\n    24→- **Initial state:** User is on `/login` in login mode.\n    25→- **Action:** User types \"test@example.com\" in the email field, then toggles to register mode.\n    26→- **Expected:** The register form fields are empty (no carried-over email value).\n    27→\n    28→### Component: LoginForm\n    29→\n    30→#### Test: Login with valid email redirects to home\n    31→- **Initial state:** User is on `/login` in login mode. A user with email \"guest@example.com\" exists in the database.\n    32→- **Action:** User types \"guest@example.com\" in the email input and clicks the \"Log In\" button.\n    33→- **Expected:** The app calls `POST /api/auth` with the email, stores the returned user object in Redux state, and redirects to the home page (`/`).\n    34→\n    35→#### Test: Login with empty email shows validation error\n    36→- **Initial state:** User is on `/login` in login mode.\n    37→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Log In\" button without entering an email.\n    38→- **Expected:** A validation error message is displayed (e.g., \"Email is required\"). No API call is made.\n    39→\n    40→#### Test: Login with invalid email format shows validation error\n    41→- **Initial state:** User is on `/login` in login mode.\n    42→- **Action:** User types \"not-an-email\" in the email field and clicks \"Log In\".\n    43→- **Expected:** A validation error message is displayed (e.g., \"Please enter a valid email address\"). No API call is made.\n    44→\n    45→#### Test: Login with non-existent email shows error\n    46→- **Initial state:** User is on `/login` in login mode. No user with email \"unknown@example.com\" exists.\n    47→- **Action:** User types \"unknown@example.com\" and clicks \"Log In\".\n    48→- **Expected:** An error message is displayed (e.g., \"No account found with this email\"). The user remains on the login page.\n    49→\n    50→#### Test: Login form email input is functional on repeated use\n    51→- **Initial state:** User is on `/login` in login mode.\n    52→- **Action:** User types \"wrong@example.com\", submits and gets an error, then clears the field, types \"guest@example.com\", and clicks \"Log In\" again.\n    53→- **Expected:** The second submission succeeds, the user is logged in and redirected to home.\n    54→\n    55→### Component: RegisterForm\n    56→\n    57→#### Test: Register with valid name and email creates account and redirects to home\n    58→- **Initial state:** User is on `/login` in register mode. No user with email \"newuser@example.com\" exists.\n    59→- **Action:** User types \"New User\" in the name field and \"newuser@example.com\" in the email field, then clicks \"Register\".\n    60→- **Expected:** The app calls `POST /api/auth` with name and email, stores the returned user object in Redux state, and redirects to the home page (`/`).\n    61→\n    62→#### Test: Register with empty name shows validation error\n    63→- **Initial state:** User is on `/login` in register mode.\n    64→- **Action:** User types \"newuser@example.com\" in the email field but leaves the name field empty, then clicks \"Register\".\n    65→- **Expected:** A validation error is displayed (e.g., \"Name is required\"). No API call is made.\n    66→\n    67→#### Test: Register with empty email shows validation error\n    68→- **Initial state:** User is on `/login` in register mode.\n    69→- **Action:** User types \"New User\" in the name field but leaves the email field empty, then clicks \"Register\".\n    70→- **Expected:** A validation error is displayed (e.g., \"Email is required\"). No API call is made.\n    71→\n    72→#### Test: Register with invalid email format shows validation error\n    73→- **Initial state:** User is on `/login` in register mode.\n    74→- **Action:** User types \"New User\" in the name field and \"bad-email\" in the email field, then clicks \"Register\".\n    75→- **Expected:** A validation error is displayed (e.g., \"Please enter a valid email address\"). No API call is made.\n    76→\n    77→#### Test: Register with already-existing email shows error\n    78→- **Initial state:** User is on `/login` in register mode. A user with email \"existing@example.com\" already exists.\n    79→- **Action:** User types \"Some Name\" in the name field and \"existing@example.com\" in the email field, then clicks \"Register\".\n    80→- **Expected:** An error message is displayed (e.g., \"An account with this email already exists\"). The user remains on the register form.\n    81→\n    82→#### Test: Register form fields are functional on repeated use\n    83→- **Initial state:** User is on `/login` in register mode.\n    84→- **Action:** User fills in name and an already-existing email, submits and gets an error, then changes the email to a new unique email and clicks \"Register\" again.\n    85→- **Expected:** The second submission succeeds, the user is registered and redirected to home.\n    86→\n    87→## Page: Home / Search (`/`)\n    88→\n    89→<!-- Components: SearchBar, CategoryFilter, PropertyGrid, PropertyCard, FavoriteButton, FiltersPanel, Pagination -->\n    90→\n    91→### Component: SearchBar\n    92→\n    93→#### Test: Search bar displays all input fields on load\n    94→- **Initial state:** User navigates to the home page (`/`).\n    95→- **Expected:** The search bar is visible at the top of the page containing four inputs: a location text input with placeholder \"Where are you going?\", a check-in date picker, a check-out date picker, and a guest count selector. A search/submit button with a magnifying glass icon is visible.\n    96→\n    97→#### Test: Search by location filters property results\n    98→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page. Properties exist in \"Paris\", \"New York\", and \"Tokyo\".\n    99→- **Action:** User types \"Paris\" into the location input and clicks the search button.\n   100→- **Expected:** The property grid updates to show only properties where the city matches \"Paris\". Properties in other cities are not displayed."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01AcAwQJJqU6JH3s8U7y74Zn","session_id":"f65fbc7d-7519-48b6-af78-4161af35e017","uuid":"837e7cc2-e1a7-47fc-8d6e-b4a50105d3d1"}
