[2026-03-14T21:05:04.610Z] {"type":"system","subtype":"task_notification","task_id":"ad17be8a1306dbbc2","tool_use_id":"toolu_01AcAwQJJqU6JH3s8U7y74Zn","status":"completed","output_file":"","summary":"Explore airbnb-clone app structure","usage":{"total_tokens":77024,"tool_uses":36,"duration_ms":56003},"uuid":"af1ce957-adec-46c8-83dc-8e106783be8e","session_id":"f65fbc7d-7519-48b6-af78-4161af35e017"}
[2026-03-14T21:05:04.610Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AcAwQJJqU6JH3s8U7y74Zn","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me create a comprehensive summary of my findings.\n\n## Comprehensive Exploration Report: AirbnbClone App\n\nI've completed a thorough exploration of the airbnb-clone application. Here are my findings:\n\n### 1. **Documentation**\n- **File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md`\n- **Contents:** Comprehensive test specifications for all pages and components, including detailed test cases for the entire Add Listing form workflow (Steps 1-7)\n\n### 2. **Playwright Configuration**\n- **File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/playwright.config.ts`\n- **Key Settings:**\n  - Test directory: `./tests`\n  - Base URL: `http://localhost:8888`\n  - Web server: Netlify dev on port 8888 with functions at `./netlify/functions`\n  - Single worker (no parallelization)\n  - Timeout: 60000ms, expect timeout: 10000ms\n  - Reporter: ReplayIO (disabled upload), JSON, and HTML\n\n### 3. **Test Files**\n- **Location:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/`\n- **Add Listing Form Tests:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/add-listing-form.spec.ts` (547 lines)\n  - Tests for Steps 1-6 (Step 7 tests are documented but not yet implemented in the spec file)\n  - Tests cover: property type selection, title validation, location/address with Nominatim autocomplete, property details (guests/beds/rooms), amenities selection, photos, and pricing\n  - Tests validate: form navigation, data persistence, error handling, and button interactions\n\n### 4. **Multi-Step Listing Form Structure**\n\n**Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/AddListingForm.tsx` (809 lines)\n\n**7-Step Flow:**\n\n1. **Step 1 - Property Type & Title**\n   - Property type dropdown (8 types: Apartment, House, Cabin, Villa, Condo, Loft, Cottage, Townhouse)\n   - Title input field\n   - Validation: Both required\n\n2. **Step 2 - Location**\n   - Address input with Nominatim OpenStreetMap autocomplete\n   - City, State, Country fields\n   - Auto-population from selected address suggestion\n   - Validation: City and Country required\n\n3. **Step 3 - Property Details**\n   - Max Guests, Bedrooms, Beds, Bathrooms (increment/decrement controls)\n   - All start at 1, user can modify\n   - Validation: All must be at least 1\n\n4. **Step 4 - Amenities**\n   - Categorized amenities (Essentials, Features, Safety, Location)\n   - Checkbox selection (optional)\n   - Grouped by category with visual toggle states\n\n5. **Step 5 - Photos**\n   - Photo URL input field\n   - Add Photo button\n   - Photo grid display (2-3 columns)\n   - Remove button on hover\n   - Validation: At least one photo required\n\n6. **Step 6 - Pricing**\n   - Price per night input (required, must be > 0)\n   - Cleaning fee input (defaults to 0, optional)\n   - Currency prefix ($) shown\n   - Validation: Price per night required and > 0\n\n7. **Step 7 - Review & Publish**\n   - Summary display of all entered data:\n     - Property type & title\n     - Full address (address, city, state, country)\n     - Details (guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms)\n     - Selected amenities\n     - Photo thumbnails (scrollable)\n     - Pricing (price per night, cleaning fee)\n   - \"Publish\" button (replaces \"Next\")\n   - \"Back\" button to revise\n   - Publish action creates property and uploads images\n\n**Form Structure Features:**\n\n- **Step Indicator:** Visual display showing \"Step X of 7\" with numbered circles; completed steps show checkmarks\n- **Navigation Buttons:**\n  - Cancel: Always visible (top-right X and bottom-left text)\n  - Back: Appears on steps 2-7, clears validation errors\n  - Next: Steps 1-6, validates current step\n  - Publish: Step 7 only, creates property and images\n- **Discard Dialog:** \n  - Appears when Cancel clicked\n  - Title: \"Discard your listing?\"\n  - Message: \"All entered information will be lost.\"\n  - Buttons: \"Keep Editing\" and \"Discard\"\n  - Test IDs: `discard-dialog`, `discard-dialog-keep`, `discard-dialog-confirm`\n\n**Form Data Structure:**\n```typescript\ninterface FormData {\n  propertyType: string\n  title: string\n  address: string\n  city: string\n  state: string\n  country: string\n  latitude: number | null\n  longitude: number | null\n  maxGuests: number\n  bedrooms: number\n  beds: number\n  bathrooms: number\n  selectedAmenities: string[]\n  photos: { url: string; caption: string }[]\n  pricePerNight: string\n  cleaningFee: string\n  description: string\n}\n```\n\n### 5. **API Endpoints**\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/`\n\n**Key Endpoints:**\n\n1. **POST /api/properties** - Create property\n   - Takes: host_id, title, description, property_type, price_per_night, cleaning_fee, max_guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms, address, city, state, country, latitude, longitude, amenity_ids\n   - Returns: Property object with generated ID\n   - Also inserts property_amenities associations if provided\n\n2. **POST /api/property-images** - Upload property images\n   - Takes: property_id, url, caption, display_order\n   - Returns: Image object with ID\n   - Called sequentially for each photo during publishing\n\n3. **GET /api/properties** - List properties with filtering\n   - Query params: city, check_in, check_out, guests, property_type, min_price, max_price, min_bedrooms, min_beds, min_bathrooms, amenities, page, limit\n   - Returns: Paginated properties with ratings and review counts\n\n4. **GET /api/properties/:id** - Get property detail\n   - Returns: Full property with host info, images, amenities, reviews\n\n5. **PUT /api/properties/:id** - Update property\n   - Supports: is_active, title, description, price_per_night, cleaning_fee\n\n6. **DELETE /api/properties/:id** - Deactivate property\n   - Sets is_active to false\n\n**Other Related Endpoints:**\n- GET/POST `/api/amenities` - List and manage amenities\n- GET `/api/host-listings?host_id=...` - Get host's listings\n- GET `/api/host-stats?host_id=...` - Get host statistics\n\n### 6. **Seed Data**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/scripts/seed-db.ts`\n\n**Sample Properties Created:**\n- 5 properties seeded for testing\n- Amenities: 18 amenities across 4 categories (Essentials, Features, Safety, Location)\n- Users: 2 hosts (Sarah Chen, Mike Johnson) + 2 guests\n- Bookings: 6 sample bookings with various statuses\n- Reviews: 2 sample reviews\n- Favorites: 4 favorite entries\n\n**Host User Example:**\n- Email: `sarah@example.com`\n- Name: `Sarah Chen`\n- ID: `a1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111`\n- Listings: 3 (Downtown Loft, Beachfront Villa, Townhouse)\n\n### 7. **State Management**\n\n**Redux Slices:**\n\n1. **hostSlice** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/hostSlice.ts`)\n   - `fetchHostStats()` - Get stats (listings count, active bookings, earnings, rating)\n   - `fetchHostListings()` - Get host's properties\n   - `fetchHostBookings()` - Get bookings for host's properties\n   - `createProperty()` - Create new listing (called from AddListingForm)\n   - `deactivateProperty()` / `activateProperty()` - Toggle listing status\n   - `updateHostBookingStatus()` - Update booking status\n\n2. **amenitiesSlice** - Manages amenity list\n3. **propertiesSlice** - Global properties state\n4. **authSlice** - User authentication\n\n### 8. **Component Hierarchy**\n\n```\nApp\n├── Sidebar\n└── main\n    └── Routes\n        ├── /login → Login\n        ├── / → Home\n        ├── /properties/:id → PropertyDetail\n        ├── /trips → MyTrips\n        ├── /trips/:bookingId/review → WriteReview\n        ├── /hosting → HostDashboard\n        │   ├── StatsOverview\n        │   ├── ListingsTab (with AddListingForm modal)\n        │   │   └── AddListingForm (7-step modal)\n        │   └── BookingsTab\n        └── /profile → Profile\n```\n\n### 9. **Test Data & Amenity IDs (from tests.md)**\n\n**Sample Amenity IDs Used in Tests:**\n- Wi