er night input (required, must be > 0)\n   - Cleaning fee input (defaults to 0, optional)\n   - Currency prefix ($) shown\n   - Validation: Price per night required and > 0\n\n7. **Step 7 - Review & Publish**\n   - Summary display of all entered data:\n     - Property type & title\n     - Full address (address, city, state, country)\n     - Details (guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms)\n     - Selected amenities\n     - Photo thumbnails (scrollable)\n     - Pricing (price per night, cleaning fee)\n   - \"Publish\" button (replaces \"Next\")\n   - \"Back\" button to revise\n   - Publish action creates property and uploads images\n\n**Form Structure Features:**\n\n- **Step Indicator:** Visual display showing \"Step X of 7\" with numbered circles; completed steps show checkmarks\n- **Navigation Buttons:**\n  - Cancel: Always visible (top-right X and bottom-left text)\n  - Back: Appears on steps 2-7, clears validation errors\n  - Next: Steps 1-6, validates current step\n  - Publish: Step 7 only, creates property and images\n- **Discard Dialog:** \n  - Appears when Cancel clicked\n  - Title: \"Discard your listing?\"\n  - Message: \"All entered information will be lost.\"\n  - Buttons: \"Keep Editing\" and \"Discard\"\n  - Test IDs: `discard-dialog`, `discard-dialog-keep`, `discard-dialog-confirm`\n\n**Form Data Structure:**\n```typescript\ninterface FormData {\n  propertyType: string\n  title: string\n  address: string\n  city: string\n  state: string\n  country: string\n  latitude: number | null\n  longitude: number | null\n  maxGuests: number\n  bedrooms: number\n  beds: number\n  bathrooms: number\n  selectedAmenities: string[]\n  photos: { url: string; caption: string }[]\n  pricePerNight: string\n  cleaningFee: string\n  description: string\n}\n```\n\n### 5. **API Endpoints**\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/`\n\n**Key Endpoints:**\n\n1. **POST /api/properties** - Create property\n   - Takes: host_id, title, description, property_type, price