e.ts`)\n   - `fetchHostStats()` - Get stats (listings count, active bookings, earnings, rating)\n   - `fetchHostListings()` - Get host's properties\n   - `fetchHostBookings()` - Get bookings for host's properties\n   - `createProperty()` - Create new listing (called from AddListingForm)\n   - `deactivateProperty()` / `activateProperty()` - Toggle listing status\n   - `updateHostBookingStatus()` - Update booking status\n\n2. **amenitiesSlice** - Manages amenity list\n3. **propertiesSlice** - Global properties state\n4. **authSlice** - User authentication\n\n### 8. **Component Hierarchy**\n\n```\nApp\n├── Sidebar\n└── main\n    └── Routes\n        ├── /login → Login\n        ├── / → Home\n        ├── /properties/:id → PropertyDetail\n        ├── /trips → MyTrips\n        ├── /trips/:bookingId/review → WriteReview\n        ├── /hosting → HostDashboard\n        │   ├── StatsOverview\n        │   ├── ListingsTab (with AddListingForm modal)\n        │   │   └── AddListingForm (7-step modal)\n        │   └── BookingsTab\n        └── /profile → Profile\n```\n\n### 9. **Test Data & Amenity IDs (from tests.md)**\n\n**Sample Amenity IDs Used in Tests:**\n- WiFi: `c1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111`\n- Kitchen: `c2222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222`\n- Pool: `c7777777-7777-7777-7777-777777777777`\n\n**Test User Credentials:**\n- Host login: `sarah@example.com`\n- Guest login: `emma@example.com` or `alex@example.com`\n\n### 10. **Key Test Selectors in Add Listing Form**\n\n**Step Navigation:**\n- `add-listing-form`, `add-listing-step-1` through `add-listing-step-7`\n- `step-indicator`\n- `add-listing-next`, `add-listing-back`, `add-listing-cancel`, `add-listing-publish`\n\n**Step 1 (Property Type & Title):**\n- `property-type-select`, `property-type-option-{type}` (apartment, house, cabin, villa, condo, loft, cottage, townhouse)\n- `listing-title-input`\n\n**Step 2 (Location):**\n- `listing-address-input`, `address-suggestions`\n- `listing-city-input`, `listing-state-input`, `